--!nonstrict
--[[
	Star Fishing Hub
	----------------
	A single-file helper for Star Fishing:

	  1. Auto fishing
	  1.1 Perfect casts only - releases the cast at the top of the charge bar
	  1.2 Auto reel         - holds the reel until every star is in
	  2. Selling stars with filters (rarity and star type)

	Press RightControl to show or hide the window.
	Everything starts off. Settings are saved in the StarFishingHub folder.
]]

